          <div class="hd-slider__faq-item"><button class="hd-slider__faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Which product works for bathroom glass?<span class="hd-slider__faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><div class="hd-slider__faq-a" hidden>HDFrost, HDWhite, and HDFade are common choices when the goal is privacy, daylight, and a clean architectural finish.</div></div>
