      <h3 class="hd-pl-row__heading">HDClear — Full-Color Custom Printed Glass for Philadelphia Commercial Interiors</h3>
      <p class="hd-pl-row__body">HDClear is the flagship product: high-definition CMYK graphics plus white ink printed onto optically clear PET. It can carry brand colors, photography, wayfinding, logos, frost effects, or layered artwork while unprinted portions remain clear.</p>
      <p class="hd-pl-row__body">Philadelphia corporate interiors use HDClear for glass partitions, reception areas, lobby panels, boardroom walls, and branded storefronts where design needs to read from both sides of the glass. It gives the impression of direct-to-glass printing without the replacement glass cost.</p>
      <div class="hd-pl-row__specs">
        <div class="hd-pl-row__spec"><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-val">4</span><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-label">Printing Techniques</span></div>
        <div class="hd-pl-row__spec"><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-val">Two-Way</span><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-label">Vision</span></div>
