        <div class="hd-pl-row__spec"><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-val">10yr</span><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-label">Warranty</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hd-pl-row__pdfs"><span class="hd-pl-row__pdfs-label">HDClear Technical Documents</span><ul class="hd-pl-row__pdf-list"><li><a href="/resources/hdclear-window-film-spec-sheet-philadelphia.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hd-pl-row__pdf-link"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>HDClear Spec Sheet</a></li></ul><p class="hd-pl-row__warranty-note">100% optically clear PET in unprinted areas. Source: HDClear Film technical documentation.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hd-pl-row hd-pl-row--rev fade-in">
    <div class="hd-pl-row__img-wrap"><img src="/images/hdclear-hdfrost-window-film-philadelphia.jpg" alt="HDFrost custom printed frosted glass film in a Philadelphia conference room" title="HDFrost precision printed frosted glass Philadelphia conference room" width="768" height="960" loading="lazy" class="hd-pl-row__img" /><span class="hd-pl-row__pill">HDFrost</span></div>
    <div class="hd-pl-row__content">
      <span class="hd-pl-row__num">02</span><span class="hd-pl-row__eyebrow">Custom Printed Frost · Single Sided · Transparent</span>
      <h3 class="hd-pl-row__heading">HDFrost — Precision Printed Frosted Glass for Philadelphia Conference Rooms</h3>
      <p class="hd-pl-row__body">HDFrost prints a precise frost field onto clear PET, giving designers control over coverage, logos, bands, and pattern consistency. It is single-sided and transparent enough to preserve daylight while diffusing direct views through the glass.</p>
      <p class="hd-pl-row__body">Philadelphia law firms and financial offices use HDFrost on conference room glass when standard frosted vinyl looks too generic or begins to yellow and peel. The printed frost stays consistent across panels, making multi-room office programs feel intentional.</p>
      <div class="hd-pl-row__specs"><div class="hd-pl-row__spec"><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-val">Custom</span><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-label">Frost</span></div><div class="hd-pl-row__spec"><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-val">Single-Sided</span><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-label">Print</span></div><div class="hd-pl-row__spec"><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-val">99%</span><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-label">UV</span></div><div class="hd-pl-row__spec"><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-val">Class 0</span><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-label">Fire</span></div></div>
      <div class="hd-pl-row__pdfs"><span class="hd-pl-row__pdfs-label">HDFrost Technical Documents</span><ul class="hd-pl-row__pdf-list"><li><a href="/resources/hdclear-window-film-hdfrost-spec-philadelphia.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hd-pl-row__pdf-link"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>HDFrost Spec Sheet</a></li></ul><p class="hd-pl-row__warranty-note">Custom frost on clear PET. 10-year flat glass warranty.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hd-pl-row fade-in">
    <div class="hd-pl-row__img-wrap"><img src="/images/hdclear-hdwhite-window-film-philadelphia.jpg" alt="HDWhite variable opacity white printed glass film in Philadelphia interior glass" title="HDWhite variable opacity white glass treatment Philadelphia" width="768" height="960" loading="lazy" class="hd-pl-row__img" /><span class="hd-pl-row__pill">HDWhite</span></div>
    <div class="hd-pl-row__content">
      <span class="hd-pl-row__num">03</span><span class="hd-pl-row__eyebrow">Custom White Ink · Variable Opacity · Transparent or Translucent</span>
      <h3 class="hd-pl-row__heading">HDWhite — Variable Opacity White Glass Treatment for Philadelphia Interiors</h3>
      <p class="hd-pl-row__body">HDWhite uses custom white ink at the opacity the design requires, from transparent white detail to translucent privacy coverage. It creates a clean architectural glass surface that can be quieter than full color and more controlled than ordinary frost.</p>
      <p class="hd-pl-row__body">Healthcare waiting areas, hospitality interiors, residential bathroom glass, and premium office partitions in Philadelphia use HDWhite when the design calls for light, privacy, and a crisp white treatment. Logos, wayfinding, or pattern cutouts can be included within the white field.</p>
      <div class="hd-pl-row__specs"><div class="hd-pl-row__spec"><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-val">Clear–Translucent</span><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-label">Finish</span></div><div class="hd-pl-row__spec"><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-val">Variable</span><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-label">Opacity</span></div><div class="hd-pl-row__spec"><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-val">99%</span><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-label">UV</span></div><div class="hd-pl-row__spec"><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-val">10yr</span><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-label">Warranty</span></div></div>
      <div class="hd-pl-row__pdfs"><span class="hd-pl-row__pdfs-label">HDWhite Technical Documents</span><ul class="hd-pl-row__pdf-list"><li><a href="/resources/hdclear-window-film-hdwhite-spec-philadelphia.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hd-pl-row__pdf-link"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>HDWhite Spec Sheet</a></li></ul><p class="hd-pl-row__warranty-note">White ink privacy and design control for flat architectural glass.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hd-pl-row hd-pl-row--rev fade-in">
    <div class="hd-pl-row__img-wrap"><img src="/images/hdclear-hdfade-window-film-philadelphia.jpg" alt="HDFade gradient privacy film on Philadelphia office and storefront glass" title="HDFade gradient privacy film Philadelphia storefronts and offices" width="768" height="960" loading="lazy" class="hd-pl-row__img" /><span class="hd-pl-row__pill">HDFade</span></div>
    <div class="hd-pl-row__content">
      <span class="hd-pl-row__num">04</span><span class="hd-pl-row__eyebrow">Custom Gradient · Frost-to-Clear · Precision Print</span>
      <h3 class="hd-pl-row__heading">HDFade — Gradient Privacy Film for Philadelphia Open-Plan Offices and Storefronts</h3>
      <p class="hd-pl-row__body">HDFade prints smooth, repeatable gradients from frost-to-clear, color-to-clear, white-to-clear, or custom design-to-clear. Because the fade is digitally printed, the transition can be controlled across every panel instead of drifting from pane to pane.</p>
      <p class="hd-pl-row__body">Center City conference rooms and storefront glass use HDFade to create privacy at eye level while keeping views open above. It is especially useful for open-plan offices where full frosting would feel closed off, and for street glass that needs privacy without losing connection to the sidewalk.</p>
      <div class="hd-pl-row__specs"><div class="hd-pl-row__spec"><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-val">Gradient</span><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-label">Print</span></div><div class="hd-pl-row__spec"><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-val">Frost-to-Clear</span><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-label">Transition</span></div><div class="hd-pl-row__spec"><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-val">99%</span><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-label">UV</span></div><div class="hd-pl-row__spec"><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-val">Custom</span><span class="hd-pl-row__spec-label">Paths</span></div></div>
      <div class="hd-pl-row__pdfs"><span class="hd-pl-row__pdfs-label">HDFade Technical Documents</span><ul class="hd-pl-row__pdf-list"><li><a href="/resources/hdclear-window-film-hdfade-brochure-philadelphia.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hd-pl-row__pdf-link"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>HDFade Brochure</a></li></ul><p class="hd-pl-row__warranty-note">Gradient privacy for offices, storefronts, lobbies, and branded glass.</p></div>
